 across laboratories and countries.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-554d-73cc-9ddc-85750cc70831","description":"measurement","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-554d-7f6e-a985-9daaef214c57","description":"the relationship of biological or other phenomena to their locations","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-554d-7c9d-a301-e7cca2fc785c","description":"spiders and their kind","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-554d-7a1c-92af-a27dd300ba15","description":"wounds and injuries caused by accidents or assaults and their surgical treatment and repair","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-554d-7486-a646-6e50132324fb","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"Which venomous spider is recognized by its hourglass-shaped mark?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Black widows belong to the genus Latrodectus, and their bites can cause painful muscle cramps, though severe outcomes are uncommon.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-554d-745a-ba88-b73a1eda5a94","description":"Black Widow","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-554d-78ea-9e60-b1457dbc818f","description":"Brown Recluse","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-554d-7019-a240-b1721fd7fb69","description":"Daddy Longlegs","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-554d-7fef-959c-b4f85ea173d7","description":"Tarantula","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-554d-78da-bee5-e337ca2fed59","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"Which substance is quickly absorbed through the walls of the stomach?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Alcohol can pass into the bloodstream through the stomach lining, though most absorption occurs in the small intestine.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-554d-71cc-9d78-382ef5fab308","description":"Alcohol","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-554d-780b-a57c-6d3734351faa","description":"Butter","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-554d-7469-a06f-f8744eb6c4c5","description":"Olive oil","correct_answer":false},{"id":"