 so its body can compress through tight spaces; its beak is the main hard structure that sets a limit.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-554e-721a-8d05-69b293da4a09","description":"Octopus","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-554e-717a-b2d6-6132544c7c73","description":"Seal","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-554e-7049-bf38-c6ac345f2122","description":"Sea otter","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-554e-7462-b7e2-dbdc2b0ca3ff","description":"Dolphin","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-554e-727c-afac-9b6b0d1446bc","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"Which type of doctor specializes in surgery of the bones and joints?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"Orthopedists (orthopedic surgeons) treat bone and joint disorders such as fractures and arthritis.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-554e-74a4-8cd4-191097ca74f3","description":"Orthopedist","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-554e-7326-9dee-54bc0d04315d","description":"Podiatrist","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-554e-7c51-949c-1adadda773b3","description":"Dermatologist","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-554e-7cb9-b9e6-2e4a303f0674","description":"Cardiologist","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-554e-74d8-9b56-122a3c291338","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","question":"What number is the binary 1000000 equal to?","difficulty":2,"explanation":"64 is 2\u2076, so its binary form has a 1 in the 2\u2076 place and zeros in every lower place.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-554e-74ba-be79-1727f2769190","description":"64","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-554e-7da9-ad61-bd6fdf8b1adb","description":"100","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-554e-79a6-9f4f-fe26c02d7eca","description":"8","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-554e-7207-ab05-50c8d8a1b9d4","description":"50","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-554e-7ca6-a4b1-a0e2d02be93c","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7df1-b0c8-10e72868dcc8","